    "wl_image_text_cta_za6tW4": {
      "type": "wl-image-text-cta",
      "blocks": {
        "image_ipYjV6": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cbg-and-cbd.png",
            "bkg_color": "#595378",
            "font_color": "#ffffff",
            "tagline": "",
            "title": "What Are CBD Gummies?",
            "content": "<p>CBD gummies are soft, chewy candies infused with <strong>cannabidiol (CBD)</strong>—a <a href=\"https://www.health.harvard.edu/blog/cannabidiol-cbd-what-we-know-and-what-we-dont-2018082414476\">non-intoxicating cannabinoid</a> extracted straight from the hemp plant. Unlike THC, CBD won't get you high and isn't addictive, making it a tasty, easy-to-dose alternative to tinctures or oils for wellness support like stress relief, better sleep, and relaxation. Pop one in your mouth and you're good to go—no droppers, no guesswork, just delicious daily wellness that works.</p><p><strong>Perfect for on-the-go routines</strong>, CBD gummies deliver consistent doses in every bite. Whether you're new to CBD or a seasoned tribe member, gummies offer a discreet, convenient way to support your wellness goals. Learn more about <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/pages/what-is-cbd\">what is cbd</a> and how it works with your body.</p>",
            "cta_text": "",
            "cta_link": ""
          }
        },
        "image_Cam9hg": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_17_2026_04_24_09_PM.png",
            "bkg_color": "#ffd700",
            "font_color": "#010101",
            "tagline": "",
            "title": "How CBD Gummies Work",
            "content": "<p>CBD gummies interact with your body's <strong>endocannabinoid system (ECS)</strong>, which <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC5549367/\">helps maintain balance</a> by preventing the breakdown of natural endocannabinoids. This may promote relaxation, reduce anxiety and stress, and improve sleep quality—all without the high. Effects typically kick in within 30-90 minutes as they're digested, delivering steady, long-lasting support throughout your day or night. Want to dive deeper? <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/blogs/blog/what-is-the-endocannabinoid-system\">Learn about the endocannabinoid system</a> and how it regulates your wellness.<br/><br/></p>",
            "cta_text": "",
            "cta_link": ""
          }
        },
        "image_GP3xtF": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/plant-powered-focus-blend.png",
            "bkg_color": "#bcd868",
            "font_color": "#010101",
            "tagline": "",
            "title": "CBD Gummies VS Delta 9 THC Gummies",
            "content": "<p>While both products are gummy-based cannabinoid supplements, they are designed for different experiences. HempLucid's <strong>Full-Spectrum CBD Gummy Cubes</strong> contain 25mg of CBD per gummy and are formulated for everyday wellness support, featuring organic hemp extract and clean ingredients without artificial dyes, sweeteners, or corn syrup. </p><p>In contrast, our <strong>Delta-9 THC + CBD Gummies</strong> combine 5-10mg of Delta-9 THC with 10-50mg of CBD, creating a more noticeable cannabinoid experience that may promote deeper relaxation and a mild psychoactive effect. HempLucid positions these gummies for consumers seeking an extra level of support beyond CBD alone, with effects typically felt more quickly than traditional CBD gummies. </p><p>For customers who want the wellness benefits of hemp without a significant THC experience, the Full-Spectrum CBD Gummy Cubes are the better fit. Those looking for a stronger relaxation experience that includes the effects of THC may prefer the CBD + Delta-9 THC Gummies. </p>",
            "cta_text": "",
            "cta_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
